  "title": "The emergence of a self is the emergence of a world",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "1f24c9e8-ddad-434f-baaa-1609145a954d",
      "text": "The emergence of a self brings with it a correlative domain of interactions proper to that self, an Umwelt. The organism’s world is the sense it makes of the environment, a place of significance and valence.",
